/ Where the items' category suggestions came from, why there are none, and "Suggest categories again"
/ (ReceiptCategoriseJob; docs/domain.md, "Category suggestions"). Outside the review form: it is a form of its
/ own, and asking again never touches typed work (suggestions fill no field).
- if receipt.extracted? && receipt.reviewable? && !receipt.card_slip? && receipt.items.any?
  - again = capture do
    = ui_button_to suggest_categories_receipt_path(receipt, filter.to_params), variant: :ghost, size: :sm do
      = ui_icon "sparkles"
      span Suggest categories again
  - if receipt.categoriser_error.present?
    = render "ui/callout", tone: :signal do
      .flex.flex-wrap.items-center.justify-between.gap-3
        p.text-sm
          strong No suggestions from the categoriser.
          |  It could not answer
          code.mx-1.text-xs = "(#{receipt.categoriser_error})"
          | ; items named like ones you labelled before still have theirs. The receipt can be reviewed as it is.
        = again
  - else
    .flex.flex-wrap.items-center.justify-between.gap-3
      p.text-sm.text-ink-muted = receipt_suggestions_summary(receipt)
      = again
